{"id":585,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"道義実践・勤勉努力・一能専念を重視","feature_description":"豊島岡女子学園は「道義実践・勤勉努力・一能専念」を教育方針に掲げます。日々の授業やクラブ活動を通じて、正しい行い、努力を続ける姿勢、自分の得意なことを深める姿勢を育てます。毎朝の運針は、集中力と基礎を身につけ、物事に粘り強く取り組むための取り組みとして続けられています。学校生活全体で学びと実践を重ねます。自ら考えて行動する力も育みます。","clubs":[{"id":11052,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11053,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11054,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11055,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11056,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11057,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11058,"name":"エアロビクス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11059,"name":"登山部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11060,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11061,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11062,"name":"政経部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11063,"name":"地歴部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.toshimagaoka.ed.jp/school_life/clubs/","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11064,"name":"数学部","category":"文化部","source_